This package is a FlutterFire platform implementation: it implements the
platform interface of the FlutterFire firebase_remote_config plugin
(firebase_remote_config_platform_interface, Copyright 2022 the Chromium project
authors, BSD 3-Clause license) and the platform interface of firebase_core
(firebase_core_platform_interface, BSD 3-Clause license). It depends on those
packages; it does not copy their code. The work is done by
firebase_remote_config_dart and firebase_installations_dart, unofficial clients
of the Firebase Remote Config and Firebase Installations REST APIs.

